{"type": "message", "message": "The idea was **coziness through texture and gentle lighting, rather than more furniture**:\n\n- A rug visually links the sofa and armchair into one inviting seating area.\n- Cream or oatmeal upholstery and warm wood soften the palette.\n- A shaded lamp beside the seating adds a gentle evening glow.\n- Keeping the dining area simple avoids competing with that relaxed sitting space.\n\nIt was a design concept, not an exact furniture layout—no positions were finalized or changes applied.", "conversationId": "452e9fff0aea49f4b2637b45ac4d8ee6"}
